# Warpgate + Infisical appliance

Warpgate is the SSH session boundary. Target credentials are resolved from Infisical just in time by the Warpgate process and are never returned to the MCP appliance.

Persistent state lives under /docker/warpgate. The Infisical Universal Auth client secret is stored root-only at /docker/warpgate/infisical-client-secret and is mounted into the Warpgate container as a Docker secret. Target records contain only Infisical references, not target passwords or private keys.
